WORLDS — PurpleHat Events (43 styles, one mark)

Made entirely in code (Canvas 2D in headless Chromium, numpy/scipy audio) with the Lemo-Opuscar
directing method and toolkit (MIT, github.com/lemomo-ai/lemo-opuscar). Style grammar from its 43 STYLE.md
guides; no demo code, characters, shots or melodies reused. All art, score and sound are original.

